IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `insolv53-nouns`

-- Row il-53. THE PRINTED FIGURES AND THE CONTROLS, as typed values, and the few functions that compare them.
-- Two defects are recorded, each with one sound control taken from another instruction of the same section of the amending chapter and read from the same page.
-- DEFECT 1: Execution Law s 7א2, paragraphs (1) and (2), as section 361 of the Insolvency Law inserted it: both paragraphs cover a total debt of exactly 150,000 shekels.
-- DEFECT 2: Execution Law s 76(ג), as section 361 of the Insolvency Law wrote it: a fixed figure of 26,000 shekels beside the two figures the Insolvency Law fixes in its own s 234(א)(1)(א), 25,630 and 39,945, as enacted.
-- CONTROL 1 (for defect 1): instruction (10) of section 361, to Execution Law s 77א. CONTROL 2 (for defect 2): instruction (8) of section 361, to Execution Law s 69י1.
-- A failing assertion states what the words need if one reading is to hold; each failing assertion is in the expected-red file with its count declared in check.sh and encoding.json.
-- LIMBS. Limb (a) is the question what the amending instruction wrote, read from the page image of the official instrument. Limb (b) is the question whether the Execution Law's present words are those words;
-- it rests on the Hebrew Wikisource consolidation (excerpt, revision 3099076) and is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY: no later instrument was read.
-- `src:N` is line N of the deposited EXCERPT, not of the whole page; the excerpt's `page line` markers give the page line.
-- A figure for which the sources held give no answer is NOTHING; there is no REFUSE.

§ `Functions`

GIVEN p IS A `A paragraph with a debt figure`
      debt IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the paragraph applies to a total debt of` MEANS
    CONSIDER p's `the paragraph meets the figure so that`
        WHEN `it applies when the total debt is at most the figure` THEN debt AT MOST p's `the figure in shekels`
        WHEN `it applies when the total debt is at least the figure` THEN debt AT LEAST p's `the figure in shekels`

GIVEN s IS A `A section of two paragraphs`
      debt IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number of paragraphs of the section that apply to a total debt of` MEANS
    (IF `the paragraph applies to a total debt of` (s's `the first paragraph`) debt THEN 1 ELSE 0)
    + (IF `the paragraph applies to a total debt of` (s's `the second paragraph`) debt THEN 1 ELSE 0)

GIVEN s IS A `A section of two paragraphs`
      debt IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`both paragraphs apply to a total debt of` MEANS
    `the paragraph applies to a total debt of` (s's `the first paragraph`) debt
    AND `the paragraph applies to a total debt of` (s's `the second paragraph`) debt

GIVEN p IS A `A paragraph with a debt figure`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the consolidation prints the figure the official instrument prints in the paragraph` MEANS p's `the consolidation prints the paragraph's figure` EQUALS p's `the figure in shekels`

GIVEN f IS A `A figure fixed by a provision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the consolidation prints the figure the official instrument prints in the provision` MEANS f's `the consolidation prints the provision's figure` EQUALS JUST (f's `the provision's figure in shekels`)

GIVEN f IS A `A figure fixed by a provision`
      g IS A `A figure fixed by a provision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the two provisions fix the same figure` MEANS f's `the provision's figure in shekels` EQUALS g's `the provision's figure in shekels`

GIVEN f IS A `A figure fixed by a provision`
      g IS A `A figure fixed by a provision`
      h IS A `A figure fixed by a provision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the first provision fixes one of the two figures that the second and the third fix` MEANS
    f's `the provision's figure in shekels` EQUALS g's `the provision's figure in shekels`
    OR f's `the provision's figure in shekels` EQUALS h's `the provision's figure in shekels`

GIVEN i IS A `An amending instruction and its target`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the target as consolidated holds the words the instruction brings in` MEANS i's `the words the instruction brings in` EQUALS i's `the words found in the target as consolidated`

GIVEN p IS A `A paragraph with a debt figure`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`both limbs of the paragraph were read from the official instruments` MEANS
    p's `limb (a): the words as the amending instruction wrote them were read from` EQUALS `the official instrument, read from its page image`
    AND p's `limb (b): that the present words are those words was read from` EQUALS `the official instrument, read from its page image`

GIVEN f IS A `A figure fixed by a provision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`both limbs of the provision were read from the official instruments` MEANS
    f's `limb (a): the words as the instrument wrote them were read from` EQUALS `the official instrument, read from its page image`
    AND f's `limb (b): that the present words of the provision are those words was read from` EQUALS `the official instrument, read from its page image`

GIVEN i IS A `An amending instruction and its target`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the instruction and the target were both read from the official instruments` MEANS
    i's `the instruction was read from` EQUALS `the official instrument, read from its page image`
    AND i's `the target's words were read from` EQUALS `the official instrument, read from its page image`

§ `Defect 1: Execution Law section 7א2, two paragraphs that both cover exactly 150,000`

-- THE ENACTED WORDS (limb a). Sefer HaChukim 2708 p. 407, read from the page image: the text of section 7א2 as the instruction inserts it, with its marginal heading.
-- The instruction is item (3) of section 361 of the Insolvency Law, which amends the Execution Law. Its opening words are on the page before p. 407, which was not imaged;
-- the section number 361, and that the items before (4) are (1) and (2), were taken from the text layer of that page in the whole issue as downloaded, which is not deposited, so this cannot be checked from the bundle; the number (3) is inferred from the sequence; none of it is verified against an image.
-- ext:[SH 2708 p.407, read from the page image] | הודעת חייב על כך שאין ביכולתו לשלם את החוב הפסוק
-- ext:[SH 2708 p.407, read from the page image] | (1) אם סך חובותיו של החייב אינו עולה על 150,000 שקלים חדשים, יראו את הודעתו כבקשה לצו לפתיחת הליכים לפי
-- ext:[SH 2708 p.407, read from the page image] | (2) אם סך חובותיו של החייב הוא 150,000 שקלים חדשים לפחות, תמסור לו לשכת ההוצאה לפועל מידע לגבי האפשרות להגיש בקשה
-- So paragraph (1) covers every total debt up to and including 150,000, and paragraph (2) every total debt from 150,000 upward, 150,000 included: a total debt of exactly 150,000 is covered by both.
-- THE PRESENT WORDS (limb b), CONSOLIDATION-ONLY: the consolidation, revision 3099076, shows the same two paragraphs, and the amendment tag on the section (excerpt line 8) holds one label, תשע״ח־5; which instrument that label stands for was not looked up here.
-- src:8 | סעיף 7א2 – הודעת חייב על כך שאין ביכולתו לשלם את החוב הפסוק [תיקון: תשע״ח־5]
-- src:10 | (1) אם סך חובותיו של החייב אינו עולה על 150,000 שקלים חדשים, יראו את הודעתו כבקשה לצו לפתיחת הליכים לפי סימן א׳ לפרק י״ב בחלק ג׳ לחוק חדלות פירעון ושיקום כלכלי; החייב יצרף להודעה את המסמכים שיש לצרף לבקשת יחיד לצו לפתיחת הליכים לפי סעיף 104 לחוק האמור;
-- src:11 | (2) אם סך חובותיו של החייב הוא 150,000 שקלים חדשים לפחות, תמסור לו לשכת ההוצאה לפועל מידע לגבי האפשרות להגיש בקשה לצו לפתיחת הליכים לממונה על הליכי חדלות פירעון ושיקום כלכלי, לפי פרק ב׳ לחלק ג׳ לחוק חדלות פירעון ושיקום כלכלי.
-- THE INSOLVENCY LAW'S OWN 150,000. Section 352(א) of the Insolvency Law, in Sefer HaChukim 2708, says that the amounts fixed in that Law are updated each 1 January by the change in the consumer price index.
-- That was read from the text layer of the whole issue as downloaded only: its page is not deposited, was not imaged and is not cited, so it cannot be checked from the bundle and is unverified against an image. No updated figure is stated in this row.
-- The words of paragraphs (1) and (2) quoted above do not refer to section 352 or to any figure of the Insolvency Law, so whether the figure in section 7א2 follows the Insolvency Law's figure is not answered by the words read.
`paragraph: Execution Law s 7א2(1)` MEANS
    `A paragraph with a debt figure` WITH
        `the paragraph is` IS "Execution Law s 7א2(1): the paragraph for a total debt that is not more than the figure"
        `the figure in shekels` IS 150000
        `the paragraph meets the figure so that` IS `it applies when the total debt is at most the figure`
        `the consolidation prints the paragraph's figure` IS 150000
        `limb (a): the words as the amending instruction wrote them were read from` IS `the official instrument, read from its page image`
        `limb (b): that the present words are those words was read from` IS `the consolidation only`

`paragraph: Execution Law s 7א2(2)` MEANS
    `A paragraph with a debt figure` WITH
        `the paragraph is` IS "Execution Law s 7א2(2): the paragraph for a total debt that is at least the figure"
        `the figure in shekels` IS 150000
        `the paragraph meets the figure so that` IS `it applies when the total debt is at least the figure`
        `the consolidation prints the paragraph's figure` IS 150000
        `limb (a): the words as the amending instruction wrote them were read from` IS `the official instrument, read from its page image`
        `limb (b): that the present words are those words was read from` IS `the consolidation only`

`section: Execution Law s 7א2` MEANS
    `A section of two paragraphs` WITH
        `the section is` IS "Execution Law s 7א2, as inserted by the Insolvency Law, section 361"
        `the first paragraph` IS `paragraph: Execution Law s 7א2(1)`
        `the second paragraph` IS `paragraph: Execution Law s 7א2(2)`

