§ `Defect 2: Execution Law section 76(ג), a fixed 26,000 beside 25,630 and 39,945`

-- THE FIXED FIGURE (limb a). Sefer HaChukim 2708 p. 407, read from the page image: instruction (9) of section 361, which writes the end of section 76(ג) of the Execution Law.
-- The instrument that wrote the OLD end of section 76(ג), the words from "תחול עד לסכום", was not read, so what the 26,000 replaced is not known.
-- ext:[SH 2708 p.407, read from the page image] | (9) בסעיף 76(ג), במקום הסיפה החל במילים "תחול עד לסכום" יבוא "תחול עד לסכום של 26,000 שקלים חדשים";
-- THE PRESENT WORDS (limb b), CONSOLIDATION-ONLY: the consolidation, revision 3099076, ends section 76(ג) with the same words.
-- The tags of sections 7א2 and 69י1 and 77א (excerpt lines 8, 13 and 20), which instructions of the same section 361 amend, carry the label תשע״ח־5; the tag of section 76 (excerpt line 16), which instruction (9) of the same section amends, does not. So the consolidation's tags are not a complete record of which instrument amended section 76.
-- src:16 | סעיף 76 – ריבוי הליכים ופסקי דין [תיקון: תשס״ט, תשע״ב, תשע״ג־2]
-- src:18 | (ג) אין בהוראות סעיף זה כדי לגרוע מזכות קדימה או מעדיפותו של זוכה או נושה על פי כל דין אחר ואולם, זכות קדימה לעניין חוב בשל אי־תשלום שכר עבודה כהגדרתו בחוק הגנת השכר, התשי״ח–1958, תחול עד לסכום של 26,000 שקלים חדשים.
-- The words that fix the figure say nothing about updating it. Whether another provision of the Execution Law updates it was not searched for in this row.
`figure: Execution Law s 76(ג), the fixed limit on the priority of a wage claim` MEANS
    `A figure fixed by a provision` WITH
        `the provision is` IS "Execution Law s 76(ג), as written by the Insolvency Law, section 361(9)"
        `what the figure limits` IS "the priority of a creditor's claim for unpaid wages"
        `the provision's figure in shekels` IS 26000
        `the consolidation prints the provision's figure` IS JUST 26000
        `the words that fix the figure also say it is updated each year` IS FALSE
        `limb (a): the words as the instrument wrote them were read from` IS `the official instrument, read from its page image`
        `limb (b): that the present words of the provision are those words was read from` IS `the consolidation only`

